# Every shell script in this repo is COPYed into the image and executed by Linux. A
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise check them out with CRLF, and
# the build dies at the first RUN with `/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or
# directory`. Normalize to LF in the working tree on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
